{"seq":1,"ts":"2026-11-13T12:36:34.621Z","type":"exp.start","exp":"E-HOSTED-RFQ-LIVE-03","attempt":1,"title":"A sealed-quote RFQ on the real hardware room with a quote that expires and a maker nobody invited: the expired quote and the uninvited one are left out, the best valid quote wins, and the production contract settles exactly","tier":"hardware","hypothesis":"Predictions are in docs/lab/PROGRAMME_PLAN.md, committed before this file existed. A quote whose validUntil has passed when the round clears is named as expired and left out; an uninvited maker with the best price is an outsider and does not win; the best valid invited quote wins; the contract charges the taker and pays the winner exactly.","limits":["One operator controls every account and the VM. This is the system working on real hardware, not independent parties.","The room sees every quote: this hides quotes from the other makers and the public, not from the room. The amount paid is public once settled.","Expiry uses the room VM's clock. The run records the difference between this machine's clock and the VM's, and waits 40 seconds against a 15 second deadline, so a skew of a few seconds cannot change the result.","A buy-side, first-price RFQ with one winner.","The VM exists for the length of the session and is deleted; no hosted room is running."],"requires":["phala-key","near-key","network","docker"],"chain_prev":"f1390691750184213eb146ed331d2ff49bb90e27fb21dfafc423ed5fa309954f","chain_hash":"be3e0852c3722499d232cc5207a1c0abb0effaf6a94d98f3745630a0ff9c7e4e"}
